abstract: >
  Systems-level production planning, utility-closure, 90-day overlapping constraint
  buffering, expansion/vertical-integration governance, and ISO/IEC pilot calibration
  framework for a modular greenfield graphene manufacturing facility. Models four
  process tracks (R2R CVD, electrochemical/ultrasonic exfoliation, wafer laminator/RIE,
  and co-axial G/CNT spinning) and macro utility skids (vacuum pump curves, 30 TR
  chillers, and 100 kVA UPS) with N+1 redundancy while excluding mechanical piece-part
  BOMs. Co-developed by Abhishek Singh with Google Gemini assistance.
keywords:
  - graphene manufacturing
  - greenfield facility planning
  - macro equipment skids
  - utility redundancy
  - ISO/TS 80004-13
  - ISO/TS 21356-1
  - IEC/TS 62607
  - Google Colab
